#: ../../explanation/overview.md:1
msgid "SparkLink SLE 协议总览"
msgstr "SparkLink SLE Protocol Overview"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:3
msgid ""
"本文从整体视角介绍 SparkLink 同步低功耗空口 (SLE) 协议的核心架构和关键概念, 帮助读者建立对协议体系的全局认知, "
"为后续深入各子层的详细解释做铺垫。"
msgstr ""
"This article provides a high-level overview of the SparkLink Synchronous "
"Low-Energy (SLE) air interface protocol, covering its core architecture and "
"key concepts to help readers establish a global understanding of the "
"protocol stack as a foundation for deeper exploration of individual "
"sublayers."

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:5
msgid "协议定位"
msgstr "Protocol Positioning"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:7
msgid ""
"SparkLink 是面向短距无线通信的协议族, SLE 是其中的同步低功耗接入技术分支。对标的国内标准为 "
"TXS-10002-2025《星闪无线通信系统 接入层 同步低功耗空口技术要求和测试方法》(V2.1.1, 2025-03-26 发布)。"
msgstr ""
"SparkLink is a protocol suite for short-range wireless communication, and "
"SLE is its synchronous low-energy access technology branch. The "
"corresponding domestic standard is TXS-10002-2025 \"SparkLink Wireless "
"Communication System — Access Layer Synchronous Low-Energy Air Interface "
"Technical Requirements and Test Methods\" (V2.1.1, published 2025-03-26)."

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:9
msgid ""
"SLE 的设计目标是在 2.4 GHz ISM 频段 (2402-2480 MHz) 实现低功耗、低时延、高可靠的短距无线链路, 典型应用场景包括:"
msgstr ""
"SLE is designed to achieve low-power, low-latency, high-reliability short-"
"range wireless links in the 2.4 GHz ISM band (2402-2480 MHz). Typical use "
"cases include:"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:11
msgid "音频传输 (耳机、车载免提)"
msgstr "Audio transmission (earphones, in-car hands-free)"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:12
msgid "近距离交互 (键鼠、遥控器)"
msgstr "Short-range interaction (keyboard/mouse, remote controllers)"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:13
msgid "传感器网络 (工业测量、环境监控)"
msgstr "Sensor networks (industrial measurement, environmental monitoring)"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:14
msgid "室内定位与感知 (基于窄带跳频或超宽带脉冲)"
msgstr ""
"Indoor positioning and sensing (narrowband frequency hopping or UWB pulses)"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:16
msgid "协议栈层次"
msgstr "Protocol Stack Layers"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:18
msgid "SLE 协议栈属于接入层, 分为两个子层:"
msgstr ""
"The SLE protocol stack belongs to the access layer and is divided into two "
"sublayers:"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:41
msgid ""
"**物理层**利用无线传输介质为数据链路层提供物理连接, 实现比特流的透明传输。其职责包括: CRC 校验、Polar 码前向纠错、HARQ "
"重传合并、速率匹配、调制解调、频率/时间同步、无线特性测量和射频处理 (标准 §6.1)。"
msgstr ""
"The **Physical Layer** provides a physical connection for the data link "
"layer over wireless media, enabling transparent bit-stream transport. Its "
"responsibilities include: CRC checking, Polar code forward error correction,"
" HARQ retransmission combining, rate matching, modulation/demodulation, "
"frequency/time synchronization, radio characteristic measurement, and RF "
"processing (Standard §6.1)."

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:43
msgid "**数据链路层**负责资源管理、访问控制、数据分段与级联、工作模式切换, 保障数据的可靠传递 (标准 §5)。"
msgstr ""
"**The data link layer** is responsible for resource management, access "
"control, data segmentation and concatenation, and operating mode switching "
"to ensure reliable data delivery (standard §5)."

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:45
msgid "核心概念"
msgstr "Core Concepts"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:47
msgid "节点角色"
msgstr "Node Roles"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:49
msgid "SLE 通信链路由两个节点组成。接入完成后, 双方角色确定为:"
msgstr ""
"An SLE communication link consists of two nodes. After access is complete, "
"the roles are determined as:"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:51
msgid "**G 节点** (Grant Node): 通常是功能较强的一方, 负责广播、调度、发起配对"
msgstr ""
"**G Node** (Grant Node): typically the more capable party, responsible for "
"broadcasting, scheduling, and initiating pairing"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:52
msgid "**T 节点** (Terminal Node): 通常是功能较简的一方, 扫描并发起接入请求"
msgstr ""
"**T Node** (Terminal Node): typically the simpler party, scans and initiates"
" access requests"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:54
msgid ""
"角色在接入阶段通过 GT 角色协商确定, 建链后可通过角色切换流程 (§7.2.15) 互换。项目中对应 `NodeRole.G_NODE` 和 "
"`NodeRole.T_NODE`。"
msgstr ""
"Roles are determined during the access phase via GT role negotiation and can"
" be swapped after link establishment through the role-switching procedure "
"(§7.2.15). In the project they correspond to `NodeRole.G_NODE` and "
"`NodeRole.T_NODE`."

#: ../../explanation/overview.md ../../explanation/overview.md:56
msgid "帧类型"
msgstr "Frame Types"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:58
msgid "标准定义了四种物理帧类型, 各自的调制方式、编码策略和用途不同:"
msgstr ""
"The standard defines four physical frame types, each with different "
"modulation schemes, coding strategies, and purposes:"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md
msgid "调制"
msgstr "Modulation"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md
msgid "信道编码"
msgstr "Channel Coding"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md
msgid "同步序列"
msgstr "Sync Sequence"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md
msgid "导频"
msgstr "Pilot"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md
msgid "典型用途"
msgstr "Typical Use"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md
msgid "FT1"
msgstr "FT1"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md
msgid "GFSK"
msgstr "GFSK"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md
msgid "无 (仅 BCH 保护头部)"
msgstr "None (BCH header protection only)"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md
msgid "32 位, GFSK"
msgstr "32-bit, GFSK"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md
msgid "无"
msgstr "None"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md
msgid "广播/发现"
msgstr "Broadcast/Discovery"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md
msgid "FT2"
msgstr "FT2"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md
msgid "PSK"
msgstr "PSK"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md
msgid "Polar(64,K)"
msgstr "Polar(64,K)"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md
msgid "64 位→32 QPSK 符号"
msgstr "64-bit → 32 QPSK symbols"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md
msgid "可选"
msgstr "Optional"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md
msgid "有连接数据"
msgstr "Connected data"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md
msgid "FT3"
msgstr "FT3"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md
msgid "Polar(256,K)"
msgstr "Polar(256,K)"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md
msgid "31+31 位→62 BPSK 符号"
msgstr "31+31 bits → 62 BPSK symbols"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md
msgid "有"
msgstr "Yes"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md
msgid "FT4"
msgstr "FT4"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md
msgid "63+63 位→126 BPSK 符号"
msgstr "63+63 bits → 126 BPSK symbols"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md
msgid "有连接数据/广播"
msgstr "Connected data/broadcast"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:67
msgid ""
"FT1 是最简单的帧类型, 适合低速率广播; FT2-FT4 依次增加同步序列长度和频谱效率, 支持 BPSK/QPSK/8PSK 调制阶数切换。"
msgstr ""
"FT1 is the simplest frame type, suitable for low-rate broadcasting. FT2-FT4 "
"progressively increase sync sequence length and spectral efficiency, "
"supporting BPSK/QPSK/8PSK modulation order switching."

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:69
msgid "链路生命周期"
msgstr "Link Lifecycle"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:71
msgid "一条 SLE 链路的典型生命周期:"
msgstr "The typical lifecycle of an SLE link:"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:98
msgid ""
"项目中 `SleNode` 类封装了完整的生命周期, 对应 `NodeState` 枚举: `IDLE → BROADCASTING/SCANNING "
"→ CONNECTING → CONNECTED → DISCONNECTED`。"
msgstr ""
"The `SleNode` class encapsulates the complete lifecycle, corresponding to "
"the `NodeState` enum: `IDLE → BROADCASTING/SCANNING → CONNECTING → CONNECTED"
" → DISCONNECTED`."

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:101
msgid "时序调度"
msgstr "Timing Scheduling"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:103
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"SLE 采用同步时分复用调度。系统基础时隙 $T_{sys} = 125\\,\\mu s$, 用 30 位计数器表示时刻。调度时隙可选 "
"25/50/75/100/125 $\\mu s$ 五种粒度。"
msgstr ""
"SLE uses synchronous time-division multiplexing scheduling. The system base "
"slot is $T_{sys} = 125\\,\\mu s$, represented by a 30-bit counter. "
"Scheduling slots can be chosen from five granularities: 25/50/75/100/125 "
"$\\mu s$."

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:105
msgid "G 节点作为调度主控方, 通过系统管理帧 (SMF) 向所有 T 节点广播时隙分配信息。每个调度点的结构:"
msgstr ""
"The G node acts as the scheduling master, broadcasting slot assignment "
"information to all T nodes via System Management Frames (SMF). The structure"
" of each scheduling point:"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:111
msgid "跳频在每个调度点执行一次, 按照预定义的跳频序列切换工作信道。"
msgstr ""
"Frequency hopping is performed at each scheduling point, switching the "
"working channel according to a predefined hopping sequence."

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:113
msgid "频率管理"
msgstr "Frequency Management"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:115
msgid ""
"SLE 窄带系统工作在 2.4 GHz 频段, 共 79 个信道 (2402-2480 MHz, 1 MHz 间隔)。跳频序列由伪随机数生成器驱动, "
"依据跳频种子和跳频地图计算每一跳的目标信道。"
msgstr ""
"The SLE narrowband system operates in the 2.4 GHz band with 79 channels "
"(2402-2480 MHz, 1 MHz spacing). The hopping sequence is driven by a pseudo-"
"random generator, computing the target channel for each hop based on the "
"hopping seed and hopping map."

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:117
msgid "跳频地图标记哪些信道\"可用\", 哪些\"被屏蔽\"。屏蔽原因通常是干扰检测或外部要求, 标准要求最少可用信道数不低于门限 (§7.2.10)。"
msgstr ""
"The hopping map marks which channels are \"available\" and which are "
"\"blocked\". Blocking typically results from interference detection or "
"external requirements; the standard mandates a minimum available channel "
"count (§7.2.10)."

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:119
msgid "代码结构与协议映射"
msgstr "Code Structure and Protocol Mapping"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:121
msgid "本项目的代码组织直接映射到 SLE 协议的层次划分:"
msgstr ""
"The project's code organization maps directly to the SLE protocol layer "
"hierarchy:"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:132
msgid "`common/` 是两层共用的编码算法库, 不直接对应标准的独立章节, 而是被物理层和数据链路层的各个流程引用。"
msgstr ""
"`common/` is a shared coding algorithm library used by both layers. It does "
"not directly correspond to a standalone standard chapter but is referenced "
"by various procedures in the physical and data link layers."

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:134
msgid ""
"`node.py` 中的 `SleNode` 是面向应用的顶层入口, 封装了从广播到断开的全部操作, 内部组合了 "
"`LinkManager`、`QosManager`、`PairingManager`、`FreqHopping`、`PowerController`、`ScheduleManager`"
" 等组件。"
msgstr ""
"`node.py`'s `SleNode` is the top-level application-facing entry point, "
"encapsulating all operations from broadcasting to disconnection. It "
"internally composes `LinkManager`, `QosManager`, `PairingManager`, "
"`FreqHopping`, `PowerControlManager` and other submodules."

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:136
msgid "数据传输约定"
msgstr "Data Transmission Conventions"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:138
msgid "标准规定了严格的比特/字节序:"
msgstr "The standard specifies strict bit/byte ordering:"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:140
msgid "最低有效位 (LSB) 最先在空口传输"
msgstr "Least significant bit (LSB) is transmitted first over the air"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:141
msgid "多字节序列按低字节优先传输 (小端序)"
msgstr "Multi-byte sequences are transmitted low-byte first (little-endian)"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:142
msgid "数值默认十进制, 支持 `0b`/`0o`/`0d`/`0x` 前缀"
msgstr "Values default to decimal; `0b`/`0o`/`0d`/`0x` prefixes are supported"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:144
msgid ""
"项目中的比特操作统一遵循此约定, 在 `common/crc.py`, `mac/frame.py` 等模块中均以 LSB-first 处理。"
msgstr ""
"All bit operations in the project follow this convention; LSB-first "
"processing is used in `common/crc.py`, `mac/frame.py`, and other modules."

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:146
msgid "下一步阅读"
msgstr "Further Reading"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:148
msgid "[物理层详解](physical-layer.md): 调制波形、帧结构、编码、发射/接收流水线的完整说明"
msgstr ""
"[Physical Layer Details](physical-layer.md): complete description of "
"modulation waveforms, frame structure, coding, TX/RX pipeline"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:149
msgid "[MAC 层详解](mac-layer.md): 广播/发现/接入流程、链路管理状态机、信令编解码"
msgstr ""
"[MAC Layer Details](mac-layer.md): broadcast/discovery/access procedures, "
"link management state machine, signaling encode/decode"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:150
msgid "[安全子系统](security.md): 配对协商、密钥派生、帧加密、隐私保护"
msgstr ""
"[Security Subsystem](security.md): pairing negotiation, key derivation, "
"frame encryption, privacy protection"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:151
msgid "[端到端数据流](data-flow.md): 从应用数据到射频信号的完整处理链路"
msgstr ""
"[End-to-End Data Flow](data-flow.md): complete processing chain from "
"application data to RF signal"

#: ../../explanation/overview.md:152
msgid "[数学原理](principles.md): Polar 码、PSK/GFSK 调制、信道模型的数学推导"
msgstr ""
"[Mathematical Principles](principles.md): mathematical derivation of Polar "
"codes, PSK/GFSK modulation, channel models"
